-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §160 ועדת מעקב עליונה: disagreements in the
-- steering committee go to a parity supreme follow-up committee (the wages
-- commissioner, the Ministry's director-general and the union's secretary
-- general), which decides unanimously and meets within 14 days of a
-- request; where it does not decide, each side may take the steps the law
-- allows it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `160 ועדת מעקב עליונה`

DECLARE `section 160 action` IS ONE OF `convene the supreme follow-up committee`, `take the steps the law allows`

DECLARE `disagreement state` IS ONE OF
    `decided by the steering committee`
    `decided by the supreme follow-up committee`
    `each side may take the steps the law allows it`

-- (א)–(ד): a disagreement in the steering committee goes up; the supreme
-- committee decides unanimously; undecided, each side is free.
@ref akn:art_160__para_a akn:art_160__para_b akn:art_160__para_c akn:art_160__para_d
`the supreme committee's members` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the Ministry of Education`, `the teachers' union`

GIVEN `steering committee unanimous` IS A BOOLEAN, `supreme committee unanimous` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `disagreement state`
DECIDE `where a disagreement ends` `steering committee unanimous` `supreme committee unanimous` IS
    BRANCH IF `steering committee unanimous` THEN `decided by the steering committee`
           IF `supreme committee unanimous` THEN `decided by the supreme follow-up committee`
           OTHERWISE `each side may take the steps the law allows it`

-- (ה): within 14 days of a request.
@ref akn:art_160__para_e
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 160 action`
DECIDE `convening the supreme committee` IS
    PARTY `the supreme follow-up committee`
    MUST  `convene the supreme follow-up committee`
    WITHIN 14
    LEST BREACH BY `the supreme follow-up committee` BECAUSE "section 160(ה): the committee meets within 14 days of a request"

#ASSERT `where a disagreement ends` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `each side may take the steps the law allows it`
#ASSERT `where a disagreement ends` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `decided by the supreme follow-up committee`
